(text "ESP32-S3 I80 Doom carrier - rev A" (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "830e5fcc-dcea-5f16-84ab-0fc1ccc59fc4"))
(text "U1: Espressif ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1-N16R8, PCB Rev1.0 only. RGB=GPIO48.\nJ1/J2 match the two 22-pin rows. USB-to-UART is the sole power/input port.\nDo not use Rev1.1: its RGB LED shares display reset GPIO38.\nThe carrier does not connect the DevKit 5V or EN pins." (at 25.4 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cefd8799-74da-5611-887f-5236aa699e46"))
(text "D0..D15 = GPIO1..GPIO16. WR=17, DC=18, CS=21, RST=38, BL=39.\nR1..R21 are 33 ohm source series resistors; LCD_CAM clock = 10 MHz.\nGPIO3 is a strapping input. DB2 has no external pull resistor.\nNo GPIO26..37, native USB19/20, UART43/44, or strap0/45/46 is driven." (at 155 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2ea8863f-dc66-50f0-8106-33dcf01ddaca"))
(text "DISP1: LCDWIKI/QDtech MRB3205, 16-bit mode: R16=0R, R8 open.\nSupply is 3V3: CLOSE module jumper J1 (LDO bypass).\nJ3 pin1..34 connects pin-for-pin via Samtec IDSD-17-D-04.00-G.\nRed stripe = pin1 at both connectors; verify continuity before power.\nRD is pulled high; SD/touch/flash CS are pulled high.\nTouch, SD, flash and audio are not used by this build." (at 265 174 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "95dd3b57-5e82-5902-85b3-66084de505bc"))
(text "80 x 100 x 1.6 mm, two copper layers; 2.9 mm NPTH at (4,4), (76,4), (4,96), (76,96).\nFull BOM includes the DevKit, display, cable, fasteners and enclosure.\nPower/current, signal integrity and physical fit remain prototype checks." (at 25.4 236.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0accd2d1-ffdf-50b2-b554-63ab549719cd"))
(embedded_fonts no)
)
